 ## Background
-The method was developed as an enhancement to the cell projection technique, which was originally proposed by Shirley and Tuchman [S2, unofficial][S3, unofficial]. The use of texture mapping for exponential transparency was introduced to address the Mach band artifacts caused by linear interpolation of opacity [S1][S2, unofficial][S3, unofficial]. The specific formulation with the $1/2$ factor in the texture map is described in [S1]. The method is associated with work at Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory [S3, unofficial].
